      <!-- ===== GUEST BANNER END ===== -->
      <h2>📝 Lesson 37 Test - Check Your Learning</h2>
      <div class="test-info"><b>Total Questions:</b> 10 &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>Total Marks:</b> 100 &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>Passing Marks:</b> 80 (80%) &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>Time:</b> 3 Minutes<br>Each correct answer = 10 Marks. Once you start, all tabs will be locked until you submit.</div>
      <div id="startScreen">
        <h2>Ready for the Test?</h2>
        <p>Click Start Paper to begin. You will get <b>3 Minutes</b> for 10 questions.<br>During the test, you cannot open Lesson or any other page.</p>
        <button class="btn" style="font-size:20px;padding:14px 30px" onclick="startTest()">▶ Start Paper</button>
      </div>
      <div id="timerBar">⏰ Time Left: <span id="timerText">03:00</span></div>
      <div id="quizArea">
        <form id="quizForm">
          <div class="question"><b>Q1. How are quiz questions stored?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="a"> Array of Objects - { question, options, answer }</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="b"> Only strings</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="c"> Only numbers</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="d"> Only HTML</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q2. What does answer: 1 mean?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> Second option (index 1) is correct</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> First option is correct</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> 1 mark</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> 1 question</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q3. What does current variable track?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="a"> Which question are we on now</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="b"> Score</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="c"> Time</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="d"> Total questions</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q4. How to check if answer is correct?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="a"> selected === questions[current].answer</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="b"> selected = questions[current].answer</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="c"> selected > answer</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="d"> selected + answer</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q5. Why disable buttons after answering?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="a"> So user cannot change answer</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="b"> To add color</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="c"> To make faster</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="d"> No reason</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q6. What does nextQuestion() do?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="a"> current++ , if more questions show next, else show result</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="b"> Restarts quiz</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="c"> Deletes question</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="d"> Adds score</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q7. When does quiz end?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="a"> When current reaches questions.length OR timer ends</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="b"> After first question</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="c"> Never</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="d"> After 1 second</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q8. How to calculate progress %?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="a"> (current / total) * 100</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="b"> current + total</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="c"> current - total</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="d"> current * total</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q9. What happens on correct answer?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="a"> score++ and button turns green</label><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="b"> score--</label><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="c"> Nothing</label><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="d"> Quiz ends</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q10. What happens on wrong answer?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="a"> Selected turns red, correct one turns green</label><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="b"> Both turn green</label><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="c"> Nothing</label><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="d"> Quiz restarts</label></div>
          <button type="button" class="btn" onclick="checkTest(false)">Submit Test - Check Result</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-next" onclick="resetTest()">Try Again</button>
